meta {
  name: Update My Username
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

patch {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/users/me/username
  body: json
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{accessToken}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "username": "new_username"
  }
}

docs {
  # Update My Username

  Updates only the username for the current user.

  ## Authentication Required
  - Yes (Bearer token)

  ## Request Body
  - `username`: New username (required, 3-50 chars)

  ## Validation
  - Username must be unique (returns 400 if already taken)
  - Username length: 3-50 characters

  ## Response
  Returns updated UserResponse with new username

  ## Use Case
  Dedicated endpoint for username updates, useful for:
  - Username-only update forms
  - Simplified frontend logic
  - Clear audit trail for username changes
}
